    "title": "SUNY New Paltz Baseball Sweeps Oneonta Series Thanks to Zykoff No-Hitter - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago Box Score Oneonta, NY — In what may be his last ever start in his career, Xavier Zykoff made history. The senior and former All-Region selection, went a full seven innings, faced 24 batters and on 92 pitches didn't let up a single hit, giving up just three walks with four strikeouts to not only earn the victory but cement himself in the program record books with the program's first no-hitter recorded in recent history. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
